PRO-BBS is a program that will allow an individual to run a
bulletin board system on a Commodore Amiga computer.  This
program is very simple to operate and requires very little time
to set up.  It is currently not suggested for public use, as it
does not have all of the necessary features required in running
a bulletin board system.

The following are descriptions and pseudocode for each module of
PRO-BBS and is intended for a programmer.

